sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway
    participant Auth
    participant Orders
    participant Billing
    Client->>Gateway: POST /orders with a very long description of the payload
    Gateway->>Auth: verify the bearer token and the scopes it carries
    Auth-->>Gateway: token is valid for orders:write
    Gateway->>Orders: create the order in the pending state
    Orders->>Billing: reserve the amount on the customer's card
    Billing-->>Orders: reservation id
    Orders-->>Client: 201 Created
